DELETE /wiki/api/v2/embeds/{id}
Delete a Smart Link in the content tree by id. Deleting a Smart Link in the content tree moves the Smart Link to the trash, where it can be restored later **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the Smart Link in the content tree and its corresponding space. Permission to delete Smart Links in the content tree in the space.
Required: id (path) — The ID of the Smart Link in the content tree to be deleted.

DELETE /wiki/api/v2/embeds/{embed-id}/properties/{property-id}
Deletes a content property for a Smart Link in the content tree by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the Smart Link in the content tree.
Required: embed-id (path) — The ID of the Smart Link in the content tree the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be deleted.

GET /wiki/api/v2/embeds/{embed-id}/properties/{property-id}
Retrieves a specific Content Property by ID that is attached to a specified Smart Link in the content tree. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the Smart Link in the content tree.
Required: embed-id (path) — The ID of the Smart Link in the content tree for which content properties should be returned.; property-id (path) — The ID of the content property being requested.

PUT /wiki/api/v2/embeds/{embed-id}/properties/{property-id}
Update a content property for a Smart Link in the content tree by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the Smart Link in the content tree.
Required: embed-id (path) — The ID of the Smart Link in the content tree the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be updated.; body (body) — The content property to be updated.
